+/// `(x & C) ==/!= 0` where every bit `C` selects is a copy of one sign bit
+/// becomes the sign test `x' >=s 0` / `x' <s 0`.
+///
+/// Two shapes put a sign bit under the mask:
+/// * `sext(x: iN) & C`: bits `N-1 .. W` of the extension all copy `x`'s sign,
