Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:55:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 42/49] inline: defer the self-recursion clone until
 rec2iter/tce_acc had their turn

Upstream's one-level self-recursion clone ran before rec2iter/tce_acc and
pre-empted the accumulator-to-loop rewrites. Partition: functions those
passes can linearise go first; the clone takes only what is left.
Callgrind binary_trees -m32 -O2: 18.958 G -> 17.699 G Ir (-6.6 %).
CCC_NO_SELF_RECURSION_CLONE=1 disables the clone. Gate rewritten to check the
partition two-sided (current build PASS, upstream order FAIL).
